{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>Passthrough Video Converter 是一款把相容影片轉換成 MP4 的本機工具，適合需要在 iPhone、iPad 或 Apple 晶片 Mac 上處理影片格式的使用者；目前<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>，原價 US $0.99。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-144.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>三種預設與本機轉換</h2>\n<p>內建快速直通、相容 1080p 與高效 HEVC 1080p 三種預設；快速直通會在來源支援時保留原有串流，避免重新編碼，另外兩種則輸出最高 1080p 的 MP4。轉換於裝置本機進行，不修改或刪除來源，輸出使用唯一名稱並先驗證大小、視訊軌與時長。iPhone 與 iPad 轉換期間須保持 App 在前景，關閉後佇列不會恢復。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-419-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-420-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-421-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-422-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/1320x2868bb-423-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：Passthrough Video Converter</li><li>應用類別：Entertainment</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/passthrough-video-converter/id6803564471?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T09:03:56.842392+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":359,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-30T08:57:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-30T08:59:24.728628+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-30T08:59:24.728628+00:00","content_hash":"2ef635117d2b0943ca08ebe3466192537bd6a0cecf43d804cd90854e84dddbcb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}